\maketitle

\begin{abstract}
The \software{hep-paper} package is the aggregate publication setup for the HEP package suite.
It configures the page geometry, language, fonts, hyperlinks, title data, bibliography, acronyms, references, floats, text helpers, and math fonts by loading the corresponding modular packages with publication-oriented defaults.
\end{abstract}

\tableofcontents\clearpage

